1 0 0 1 85 548 Tm
(Every value from the inventory or a catalog is shown in Courier, as it is stored. A character the PDF's core fonts ) Tj
1 0 0 1 50 536 Tm
(cannot show is written as a visible escape in Go's style: \\u and four hex digits up to U+FFFF \(\\u0416 is the Cyrillic letter ) Tj
1 0 0 1 50 524 Tm
(Zhe\), \\U and eight hex digits above it, \\x and two hex digits for a byte that is not valid UTF-8, and \\\\ for a backslash, so an ) Tj
1 0 0 1 50 512 Tm
(escape never looks like a value's own text. A no-break space and a soft hyphen are escaped too, so they never pass for a ) Tj
1 0 0 1 50 500 Tm
(space or for nothing.) Tj
